Z||000025||MinnGreenGT||09-28-2001||10:44 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jaei Sun:<BR><B>For those with the inner seat area that match the exterior color... where did you get it done???  Looks fantastic!!  I want to match my Laguna Seca Blue paint with my seats but have no idea.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>This isn't usually cheap, but check the phone book for automotive upholstry companies... they'll be able to do something!<P>BTW: My interior looks exactly like GTMike's (stock tan) except for the new synthetic burlwood auto shift handle I picked up!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fullstaff.gif">   <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
Z||000026||grgoyl86||09-28-2001||01:03 PM||||Any other thoughts on the Seatbelts? How to get some nice black ones?<P>------------------<BR><B>Bob Schlag</B><BR><I>Mid Atlantic Fiero Owners Association</I><BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ani_interior.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000027||FieroMaster88||09-28-2001||01:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex4mula:<BR>[B]Hey FieroMaster88;<BR>Which type of A/F ratio gage did you use? To what it connects? O2? TIA<BR>[B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, I used the AutoMeter Sport Comp A/F ratio gauge.  Purchased it from Summit Racing.  I think it was $50..but cant remember exactly.  I just spliced it into the wire for my O2 sensor by the computer.  Was not hard at all.  Just find a good wireing diagram for your computer and you should be all set. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">              <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
Z||000028||2xsess||09-28-2001||06:07 PM||||Mine is pretty rough still but I have white face gauges, 88GT dot matrix bezels and all the other parts are out of an 86GT, like the aux pod, 120mph speedo...<BR>Pics at my site.<P>AUS, I like those seats, did you get them done or do them yourself? I like MrMikes looks but I'm not that into Leather.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
