Z||000032||Tina||09-28-2001||08:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grgoyl86:<BR><B> Please, tell me more! Are they new webbing, or recolored? If new, where did you get them? I really want to do something with my belts.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, took the whole seatbelt assembly out, and replaced them with new ones.<BR>(Including bolts holding them in...a must)<BR>Found the new ones online<BR>Just search for seatbelts,only one or two out there.<BR>(Sorry no link,...deleted... long story...<BR>bottomline ..not to happy.)<BR>Fitment out of the box... not to good.<BR>(interior panels will have to be cut,seatbelt length another issue)<BR>Can you make it work? <BR>Yes....<P>Tina<BR>LMK If you need anymore details    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000033||Tina||09-28-2001||09:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jaei Sun:<BR><B>For those with the inner seat area that match the exterior color... where did you get it done???  Looks fantastic!!  I want to match my Laguna Seca Blue paint with my seats but have no idea.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Looks like most of the two-tone are from Mr. Mikes.<BR>There a place here locally that I bet would have that color in leather.<BR>The problem your going to run into is,<BR>Mr. Mike will only work with  his own matrials... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> already asked him about it)<P><BR>Tina  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>BTW Try sending him a color swatch, and see what he can come up with.<BR>Pretty nice guy to work with.....<P>||||reg||1
